o removed from the related base UoM, if hidden.","InfoMap":{"$id":"5414","FullIdObj":{"$id":"5415","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Unhides the specified Unit of Measure and the related UoM Dimension by setting the attribute IsHidden to False. In case of a base UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the UoM Factors defined between the base UoM and the other base UoMs not hidden. In case of a multiple/submultiple UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the related base UoM, if hidden.","FullInfo":"Unhides the specified Unit of Measure and the related UoM Dimension by setting the attribute IsHidden to False. In case of a base UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the UoM Factors defined between the base UoM and the other base UoMs not hidden. In case of a multiple/submultiple UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the related base UoM, if hidden.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"5415"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Unhides the specified Unit of Measure and the related UoM Dimension by setting the attribute IsHidden to False. In case of a base UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the UoM Factors defined between the base UoM and the other base UoMs not hidden. In case of a multiple/submultiple UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the related base UoM, if hidden.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Unhides the specified Unit of Measure and the related UoM Dimension by setting the attribute IsHidden to False. In case of a base UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the UoM Factors defined between the base UoM and the other base UoMs not hidden. In case of a multiple/submultiple UoM, the IsHidden setting is also removed from the related base UoM, if hidden."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"5416","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4539"},"SystemAnnotat